 "text": "Welcome to Salem, MO\nSkip to main content\nFollow Us\nFacebook link\nBusiness Directory\nAbout\nOffices\nCommissioners\nAssessor\nDent County GIS Portal\nCircuit Court clerk\nCollector of Revenue\nDent County Collector Tax Portal\nPay My Property Taxes\nCoroner\nCounty Clerk\nElections\nCounty Surveyor\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder of Deeds\nSheriff\nMissouri Department of Public Safety\nMSHP Sex Offender Registry\nCasenet\nMoVANS\nMissouri Internet Crimes Against Children Taskforce\nSouth Central MO Crimes Against Children Taskforce\nTreasurer\nBoards\nEnhanced Enterprise Zone\nIndustrial Development Authority\nSB-40\nSenior Citizens Service\nTourism Commission\nSite Selection\nHow do I\nContact Us\nRegister to Vote\nPay My Property Taxes\nUpcoming Events\n56°\n1\n2\nPrev Next\nTreasurer\nslide 1 to 3 of 3\nPlay\nDent County\nLive\nCounty Offices\nWork\nStart, Grow or Locate a Business\nSub Menu\nCounty Boards\nCommissioners\nAssessor\nCircuit Court Clerk\nCollector of Revenue\nCoroner\nCounty Clerk\nCounty Surveyor\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder of Deeds\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nHome dent Offices Treasurer\nDenita Williams (R)\nDent County Courthouse\n400 N. Main St.\nSalem, MO 65560\n573-729-8260\nOffice hours are Monday thru Friday from 8:00 AM to 4:30 PM. (Closed major holidays)\nThe county treasurer is the custodian of county revenues and maintains records and reports on both revenues and expenditures.\nIt is the treasurer's responsibility to ensure that monies are separated into the correct funds. Some money held by the treasurer may be invested for the profit of the county. Financial books are kept for the various funds and must balance.\nThe county treasurer is the custodian of all monies collected for the various taxing entities within the county (schools, fire districts, roads, etc.) and is responsible for the proper disbursement of those funds.\nMonthly, semi-annual and annual settlements are compiled and presented to the County Clerk and County Commission for inspection.\nslide 1 to 5 of 15\nCommission\nLearn More\nCollector of Revenue\nLearn More\nCounty Assessor\nLearn More\nCircuit Court Clerk\nLearn More\nPay Property Taxes\nLearn More\nCounty Clerk\nLearn More\nCounty Recorder of Deeds\nLearn More\nCounty Surveyor\nLearn More\nCounty Coroner\nLearn More\nCounty Public Administrator\nLearn More\nCounty Prosecuting Attorney\nLearn More\nCounty Sheriff\nLearn More\nCounty Election Authority\nLearn More\nTreasurer\nLearn More\nDent County History\nLearn More\n#Keep Current .\n.\n.\nSign Up for Notifications\nSign Up\nCity of Salem\n400 N. Iron St.,\nSalem, MO 65560\n573-729-4811\nSite Selection\n400 N. Iron St.\nSalem, MO 65560\n573-729-2428\nChamber of Commerce\n1136 South Main St.\nSalem, MO 65560\n573-729-6900\nVisitor Center\n1136 South Main St.\nSalem, MO 65560\n573-729-6900\nDent County\n400 N. Main St.,\nSalem, MO 65560\nSee Individual Offices\n©\nCity of Salem Dent County Tourism Tax Dollars at Work.\nPowered by Revize . The Government Website Experts. | Login\n×\nShare this page\nCopy and paste this code into your website.\n<a href=\"http://www.salemmo.com/dent/offices/treasurer.php\">Your Link Name</a>\nShare this page on your favorite Social network\nFacebook\nTwitter\nReddit\nClose\nClose\nRead More",
